00:13:32,620 --> 00:13:33,855
She'll lose it again.

250
00:13:35,340 --> 00:13:37,000
Yeah, I guess you're right.

251
00:13:37,140 --> 00:13:38,397
Well, of course I'm right.

252
00:13:38,480 --> 00:13:39,340
Now listen up.

253
00:13:39,620 --> 00:13:40,740
Yukako is insane,

254
00:13:40,940 --> 00:13:44,657
but convincing her to stop using
her hair for evil is low priority.

255
00:13:44,740 --> 00:13:47,622
We have far more pressing
concerns at the moment.

256
00:13:47,800 --> 00:13:50,537
Figuring out a way to not
provoke her comes first.

257
00:13:50,620 --> 00:13:51,997
But how do we do that?

258
00:13:52,080 --> 00:13:55,777
The truth is, it doesn't matter
how infatuated she is with you.

259
00:13:55,860 --> 00:13:58,657
If she comes to her own conclusion
that you're the most pathetic,

260
00:13:58,740 --> 00:14:03,505
disgusting schmuck around, then we get to
go on living happily ever after, right?

261
00:14:04,220 --> 00:14:06,337
So all you've got to do
on your end is act like

262
00:14:06,420 --> 00:14:08,717
a total jackass whenever
you're in front of her.

263
00:14:08,800 --> 00:14:10,737
Oh, now I get where
you're going with this!

264
00:14:10,820 --> 00:14:12,526
You're such a genius, Josuke!

265
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:14,000
Well, thank you.

266
00:14:14,220 --> 00:14:16,877
Though is it really a
compliment coming from you?

267
00:14:16,960 --> 00:14:17,790
Jeez, Luis.

268
00:14:18,060 --> 00:14:20,837
What could I do to make Yukako
think I'm totally unappealing?

269
00:14:20,920 --> 00:14:23,080
Well, from what I've been told,

270
00:14:23,520 --> 00:14:27,037
