usually major turn-offs for ladies.

271
00:14:27,120 --> 00:14:28,757
There has to be another way!

272
00:14:28,840 --> 00:14:32,497
If she thinks I'm a mama's boy, she'll
hate my mom and go after her, too!

273
00:14:32,580 --> 00:14:34,457
Then we'll have to go with option B!

274
00:14:34,540 --> 00:14:36,877
You'll be the gross guy
who doesn't take baths!

275
00:14:36,960 --> 00:14:37,790
That's right!

276
00:14:37,940 --> 00:14:40,517
You can't brush your teeth
or change your underwear!

277
00:14:40,600 --> 00:14:43,877
Raising some lice or spiders in
your hair might be a good idea!

278
00:14:43,960 --> 00:14:45,837
Wearing sweaty socks is pretty gross!

279
00:14:45,920 --> 00:14:47,797
Ooh, and try farting everywhere!

280
00:14:47,880 --> 00:14:49,277
Yeah, she'll think you're foul!

281
00:14:49,360 --> 00:14:51,360
Would you guys quit joking around?

282
00:14:51,460 --> 00:14:52,820
I'm serious about this.

283
00:14:53,060 --> 00:14:57,119
I'm being just as serious as you
are now make with the snot and drool

284
00:14:58,780 --> 00:15:00,500
If you're not up for it,

285
00:15:00,640 --> 00:15:05,464
then your only option is to become a nobody
and a nobody with no prospects at that

286
00:15:07,500 --> 00:15:09,920
You need to make her lose all interests

287
00:15:11,280 --> 00:15:14,440
You and I are gonna tackle
this thing together, okay?

288
00:15:21,880 --> 00:15:23,420
Holy shit! No way!

289
00:15:23,700 --> 00:15:25,200
Koichi Hirose did what?

290
00:15:25,400 --> 00:15:26,640
I don't believe it!

291
00:15:26,860 --> 00:15:30,417
How disgusting does a guy have
to be to stoop to shoplifting?

292
00:15:30,500 --> 00:15:32,560
I know, but Koichi said it himself.

293
00:15:33,020 --> 00:15:35,417
What's worse, the jerk was
even bragging all about it.

294
00:15:35,500 --> 00:15:36,330
Who does that?

295
00:15:36,480 --> 00:15:37,417
Think that's bad?

296
00:15:37,500 --> 00:15:40,557
Koichi wouldn't be able to keep a
promise if his life depended on it.

297
00:15:40,640 --> 00:15:43,297
I lent that asshat money
and he never paid me back.

298
00:15:43,380 --> 00:15:47,057
Yeah, well, I heard he cheats on
tests and steals girls' underwear.

299
00:15:47,140 --> 00:15:49,140
The guy's got no future.

300
00:15:49,400 --> 00:15:50,877
He'll end up ruining his life.

301
00:15:50,960 --> 00:15:52,597
I think it's time to drop the dude.

302
00:15:52,680 --> 00:15:54,120
Our friendship is over.

303
00:16:00,040 --> 00:16:03,320
Oh man, that chick gives
Intense a new definition.

304
00:16:03,860 --> 00:16:07,157
Now if Koichi can confirm tomorrow
all the stuff we said today,

305
00:16:07,240 --> 00:16:11,181
she'll lose interest faster than
a lead block falling from the sky.

306
00:16:15,420 --> 00:16:17,479
I know I should have faith in them,

307
00:16:17,640 --> 00:16:20,900
but I wonder if Josuke
and Okuyasu's plan worked.

308
00:16:23,100 --> 00:16:27,276
The best-case scenario would be her
forgetting that I exist altogether.

309
00:16:37,760 --> 00:16:39,220
What is that?

310
00:16:40,420 --> 00:16:43,320
My eyes are closed, so it must be a dream.

311
00:16:43,880 --> 00:16:44,710
Huh?

312
00:16:44,800 --> 00:16:45,720
A woman?

313
00:16:48,620 --> 00:16:49,740
It's Yukako!

314
00:16:52,120 --> 00:16:54,080
You have to be kidding me!

315
00:16:54,520 --> 00:16:56,660
She's even corrupting my dreams?

316
00:16:57,060 --> 00:16:59,680
Can't she give it a rest for one night?

317
00:17:09,780 --> 00:17:11,640
I hate to do this, Koichi,

318
00:17:11,920 --> 00:17:15,920
but I have to tell you, your friends
don't think very highly of you.

319
00:17:20,320 --> 00:17:21,540
No need to worry.

320
00:17:21,760 --> 00:17:23,020
I'm here for you now.

321
00:17:23,480 --> 00:17:27,777
And as such, it's my job to educate
you and turn you into the ideal man.

322
00:17:27,860 --> 00:17:31,684
There's something about you certain
other men seem to be lacking.

323
00:17:32,080 --> 00:17:35,139
And it's crucial that you
live up to that potential.

324
00:17:36,240 --> 00:17:39,960
Josuke, the plan backfired big time!

325
00:17:53,420 --> 00:17:55,260
What is this place?

326
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:10,780
Koichi, are you hungry now?

327
00:18:11,000 --> 00:18:12,882
Breakfast is almost ready, okay?

328
00:18:14,140 --> 00:18:15,000
Yeah, okay.

329
00:18:16,000 --> 00:18:18,677
I have to remember that
she has that hair stand.

330
00:18:18,760 --> 00:18:22,348
There's no fighting it, so I
have to find an opening and run.

331
00:18:22,880 --> 00:18:24,180
It's my only hope.

332
00:18:25,360 --> 00:18:27,060
Hey, I have a question.

333
00:18:27,640 --> 00:18:29,400
Can you answer it? I'll try.

334
00:18:29,740 --> 00:18:32,037
Well, uh, it's about what
your hair did last night.

335
00:18:32,120 --> 00:18:33,460
How did you do that?

336
00:18:33,720 --> 00:18:34,838
Were you surprised?

337
00:18:35,260 --> 00:18:36,090
Silly me.

338
00:18:36,340 --> 00:18:38,757
I suppose the first time
would startle anyone.

339
00:18:38,840 --> 00:18:40,380
It was around February.

340
00:18:41,340 --> 00:18:43,680
Somebody shot an arrow into my chest.

341
00:18:45,100 --> 00:18:47,760
Though, it's possible I was dreaming it.

342
00:18:47,940 --> 00:18:52,960
When I woke up, it was as if my wound
never existed, and I had this power.

343
00:18:54,100 --> 00:18:55,140
Keicho Nijimura!

344
00:18:55,780 --> 00:18:59,620
So, do you know anyone else with
special powers like yours? No.

345
00:19:00,200 --> 00:19:03,440
That means she has no idea
I'm a stand user, too.

346
00:19:03,820 --> 00:19:05,349
Have a seat, if you would.

347
00:19:05,480 --> 00:19:07,186
You are a growing boy, right?

348
00:19:07,460 --> 00:19:09,225
But if you don't eat properly,

349
00:19:09,720 --> 00:19:13,660
you'll never become the outstanding
man I know you can be. Crap.

350
00:19:13,940 --> 00:19:15,764
I've got to play along for now.

351
00:19:16,120 --> 00:19:18,420
This looks amazing! Oh, boy!

352
00:19:18,840 --> 00:19:20,060
Not so fast, mister.

353
00:19:20,220 --> 00:19:21,620
We need to talk. Huh?

354
00:19:21,800 --> 00:19:23,740
You failed your English test.

355
00:19:24,700 --> 00:19:27,857
While I acknowledge there's more
to a man than his intelligence,

356
00:19:27,940 --> 00:19:29,999
this pitiful score is unacceptable.

357
00:19:30,100 --> 00:19:34,037
To prepare you for the next test, you're
going to study while you eat breakfast.

358
00:19:34,120 --> 00:19:34,950
Okay?

359
00:19:40,220 --> 00:19:42,000
Now, for a few questions.

360
00:19:42,440 --> 00:19:45,028
Select the best answer
from among the boxes.

361
00:19:45,200 --> 00:19:47,257
The box you choose holds your next meal.

362
00:19:47,340 --> 00:19:48,170
Wait!

363
00:19:48,253 --> 00:19:49,083
Hold on a minute!

364
00:19:49,166 --> 00:19:49,996
You'll do what I say!

365
00:19:50,079 --> 00:19:51,717
And as long as you're
living in this house,

366
00:19:51,800 --> 00:19:54,477
your life must constantly
revolve around your betterment.

367
00:19:54,560 --> 00:19:55,390
Agreed?

368
00:19:57,200 --> 00:19:58,520
On to the question.

369
00:19:58,800 --> 00:19:59,918
In Prince's lyrics,

370
00:20:00,060 --> 00:20:04,295
he uses the words funky music, and I
want the best Japanese translation.

371
00:20:04,520 --> 00:20:05,350
A.

372
00:20:05,433 --> 00:20:06,880
Nekkyo no ongaku B.

373
00:20:07,320 --> 00:20:08,520
Genshi no ongaku

374
00:20:09,100 --> 00:20:09,930
C.

375
00:20:10,013 --> 00:20:10,960
Gensou no ongaku

376
00:20:13,140 --> 00:20:16,297
If I don't answer her question,
she'll get hysterical!

377
00:20:16,380 --> 00:20:18,117
But I don't have a flippin' clue!

378
00:20:18,200 --> 00:20:22,340
I have a hunch it's A, But it
could easily be B or C as well!

379
00:20:23,880 --> 00:20:24,710
Screw it!

380
00:20:24,860 --> 00:20:26,520
I can do this...

381
00:20:27,240 --> 00:20:29,340
My guess is... B!

382
00:20:32,920 --> 00:20:33,750
Ah!

383
00:20:33,833 --> 00:20:34,800
You got it right!

384
00:20:36,100 --> 00:20:36,930
Congratulations!

385
00:20:37,013 --> 00:20:39,109
You won a pair of
freshly hard-boiled eggs!

386
00:20:39,460 --> 00:20:42,460
I'll peel them for you with
a pinch of salt, right?

387
00:20:43,980 --> 00:20:48,509
Just so you know, if you had chosen A,
you would have had to eat this eraser.

388
00:20:49,040 --> 00:20:51,158
Box C would have been a bar of soap.

389
00:20:51,560 --> 00:20:52,860
What the hell?!

390
00:20:53,820 --> 00:20:56,397
The next item on the
menu is bacon and eggs.

391
00:20:56,480 --> 00:20:57,360
Best of luck!

392
00:20:58,100 --> 00:20:58,930
Your question.

393
00:20:59,540 --> 00:21:02,069
Which of these characters
express contrast?

394
00:21:02,380 --> 00:21:07,560
Would it be Taisho A, perhaps
Taisho B, or maybe Taisho C?

395
00:21:07,900 --> 00:21:09,665
She's not messing around here.

396
00:21:09,800 --> 00:21:13,757
If I choose the wrong box, she'll
force me to eat its contents for sure!

397
00:21:13,840 --> 00:21:15,722
I know you're stalling for time.

398
00:21:15,880 --> 00:21:17,377
Hurry or your food will get cold.

399
00:21:17,460 --> 00:21:19,397
Uh, well...

400
00:21:19,480 --> 00:21:21,357
Maybe it's...

401
00:21:21,440 --> 00:21:22,960
What do I do now?

402
00:21:23,240 --> 00:21:24,740
She's playing hardball!

403
00:21:34,340 --> 00:21:35,460
Is... Itsy?

404
00:21:36,160 --> 00:21:41,220
Tell me, Koichi, were you watching my
expressions to decide which box to pick?

405
00:21:42,320 --> 00:21:44,137
I never thought I'd say this,

406
00:21:44,220 --> 00:21:48,037
but your reputation for being a
conniving shoplifting cheater is true.

407
00:21:48,120 --> 00:21:51,957
For your penalty, you shall consume
the contents of boxes A and B.

408
00:21:52,040 --> 00:21:54,320
A is English vocab cornflakes.

409
00:21:54,500 --> 00:21:56,940
B is asparagus a la English dictionary.

410
00:21:57,400 --> 00:21:59,988
You're gonna learn with
every bite you take.

411
00:22:01,660 --> 00:22:05,740
Here, now open up that mouth,
cause here comes the knowledge.

412
00:22:06,460 --> 00:22:07,360
What's wrong?

413
00:22:08,040 --> 00:22:09,360
Eat your food, dammit!

414
00:22:11,600 --> 00:22:13,365
I've had about enough of this.

415
00:22:13,480 --> 00:22:16,577
You expect me to sit back and
take this crap while I can't!

416
00:22:16,660 --> 00:22:18,601
I'm getting the hell out of here!

417
00:22:22,040 --> 00:22:23,275
Now what's happening?

418
00:22:23,480 --> 00:22:24,900
What's pulling my scalp?

419
00:22:25,120 --> 00:22:26,885
It feels like somebody's hair!

420
00:22:27,020 --> 00:22:29,157
Wait, does this belong to...

421
00:22:29,240 --> 00:22:33,840
Indeed, I implanted a few hundred
strands of my own hair into your scalp.

422
00:22:36,760 --> 00:22:41,097
I'm well aware that you'll probably hate
me for going to these extreme measures,

423
00:22:41,180 --> 00:22:42,010
Koichi.

424
00:22:42,420 --> 00:22:44,517
But by the time you leave this house,

425
00:22:44,600 --> 00:22:48,337
you'll look in the mirror and see a
brand new man staring back at you.

426
00:22:48,420 --> 00:22:50,697
I'm certain you'll thank me after that.

427
00:22:50,780 --> 00:22:54,097
And you'll realize you need
a woman like me in your life.

428
00:22:54,180 --> 00:22:58,180
It's safe to say you won't be able
to live without Yukako Yamagishi.

429
00:23:00,280 --> 00:23:01,868
Oh, you might as well know.

430
00:23:02,020 --> 00:23:04,617
Until you finish every
last morsel on your plates,

431
00:23:04,700 --> 00:23:06,818
I won't be giving you any more food.

432
00:23:07,640 --> 00:23:08,993
There's one more thing.

433
00:23:09,140 --> 00:23:11,220
A famous CEO vacations here.

434
00:23:11,580 --> 00:23:13,992
But no one will be visiting until summer.

435
00:23:14,180 --> 00:23:15,420
Until summer?

436
00:23:16,040 --> 00:23:18,900
Although, it doesn't
really matter who drops by.

437
00:23:19,040 --> 00:23:23,080
Because in the very end,
love is an invincible power.

438
00:23:30,380 --> 00:23:32,200
Somebody help me!
